#. TRANSLATORS: Description/tagline of the application shown in the About dialog
msgid "An accessible, lightweight, fast ebook and document reader"
msgstr ""
"Ein barrierefreier, schlanker und schneller E-Book- und Dokumentenleser"

msgid ""
"Paperback is built on other people's work. The libraries it uses, and their "
"licenses, are credited at {}."
msgstr ""
"Paperback basiert auf der Arbeit anderer. Die verwendeten Bibliotheken und "
"deren Lizenzen sind unter {} aufgeführt."

